AB  - Presents a series of journal article reviews that include the following topics: Attention-Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder—Summer Sports Program; Autism Spectrum Disorder—Helping Parents’ Mental Health; Cheating Behavior in School-Age Children—Cognitive Correlates; Gun Violence in Movies; Maternal Posttraumatic Stress Disorder and Depression— Associations with Child Exposure to Trauma or Abuse; Parental Violence—Associations with Children’s Developmental Status; Parenting Skills—Enhancement in Primary Care Settings; Poverty—Effects on Children’s Brain Development; Preschool Disruptive Behaviors—A Developmental Framework; Sexual Risk Taking and Bullying in Adolescents; Sleep Duration—Associations with Eating and Weight; and Text Messaging by Adolescents—Associations with Antisocial Behavior. (PsycInfo Database Record (c) 2025 APA, all rights reserved)
